'''Pirate Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]] improves his health, range and chance to [[Knockback|knockback]] [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemies. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 9.10 Update|Version 9.10]]. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], Pirate Cat is unlocked into the Rare Capsule pool once clearing [[Saudi Arabia (Empire of Cats)|Saudi Arabia]].

